        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>PP追奶法</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #eee;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #fdf3e3;\n    border: 10px solid #f4a26a;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 14px 14px 18px 14px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .title-bubble {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #f6d9a0;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    padding: 14px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-bubble h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #f0836a, -1px -1px 0 #f0836a, 1px -1px 0 #f0836a, -1px 1px 0 #f0836a;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #f0836a;\n  }\n  .sparkle {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: #f6c343;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n  .sp1 { top: -6px; left: 10px; }\n  .sp2 { top: -10px; right: 30px; font-size: 22px; }\n  .sp3 { bottom: -8px; left: 30px; font-size: 14px; }\n  .sp4 { bottom: -12px; right: 10px; font-size: 20px; }\n  .sp5 { top: 20px; left: -8px; font-size: 12px; }\n  .sp6 { top: 30px; right: -6px; font-size: 12px; }\n\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #e8a97a;\n    padding-bottom: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 2px solid #b98d4f;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 44px 8px 12px 8px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .col-header {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -18px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: #f6d9a0;\n    border: 2px solid #b98d4f;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .col-header span {\n    color: #d94a3a;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n  .step {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 4px 2px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .step.rest {\n    color: #e05a4e;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #e2453a;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n\n  .notes {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .notes p {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .diamond {\n    color: #f0a93c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .highlight-yellow {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, #f6e07a 60%);\n  }\n  .underline-red {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #e05a4e;\n  }\n  .underline-blue {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #5a8fd6;\n  }\n  .circle-red {\n    border: 2px solid #e05a4e;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .star {\n    color: #f6c343;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp1\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp2\">✧</span>\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp3\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp4\">✧</span>\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp5\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"sparkle sp6\">✧</span>\n    <div class=\"title-bubble\">\n      <h1>PP追奶法</h1>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"col-header\"><span>单边吸奶器</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step rest\">休息5分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step rest\">休息5分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"col-header\"><span>双边吸奶器</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸20分钟基础排空</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step rest\">按摩10分钟预备排后奶</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸10分钟排出后奶</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step rest\">休息10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸10分钟泌乳信号</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <p><span class=\"diamond\">◆</span>PP法进行的最佳时间是晚上11点到次日凌晨5点，这个时间段是<span class=\"highlight-yellow\">泌乳高峰期</span>，<span class=\"star\">✦</span>尽量每天选固定的一个小时进行。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"diamond\">◆</span>三次吸奶中间有5~10分钟的休息时间，<span class=\"underline-red\">小口喝一些温开水</span>，有助于血液循环，另外，配合手掌轻轻按摩乳头，或者用<span class=\"underline-red\">热毛巾敷一敷乳房</span>，有助于刺激奶阵的产生。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"diamond\">◆</span>后续如果没<span class=\"circle-red\">有奶阵</span>了不要空吸，将吸奶器换成按摩泌乳模式继续可以吸出奶阵。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"diamond\">◆</span>吸奶器是否适合自己也很<span class=\"underline-blue\">关键</span>，有时候吸不出奶和吸奶器也有关系。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
